 ## unpublished
+### Fixed
+- `correct_charge` takes the charge from a known adduct (e.g. `[M-2H]2-` gives -2) before guessing +1/-1 from the ionmode when no charge is given.
 
 ## [0.31.0] - 2025-10-06
 ### Added
